abstract: >-
  KARZOUN-X is an open research prototype investigating resource-aware local language-model reasoning,
  retrieval augmentation, telemetry anomaly detection, deterministic epistemic evidence checks,
  deterministic action constraints, delayed or unavailable ground communication, and auditable
  fault-diagnosis decision support. The repository contains real SMAP/MSL anomaly-detection
  experiments and separately labeled synthetic diagnosis, safety, hard-stress, communication,
  resource, mitigation, and statistical-synthesis experiments. It is not flight-qualified software.
